  <Control id="Lbl-LamText" type="Label" x="48" y="160" w="1024" h="96" tab-order="0" z-order="0" visible="true" enabled="true" parent="Tab-Main" tab="4">
    <Property name="Caption">PowerCloud never signs a download link itself. When the grid or the pet&apos;s popup needs a photo, the application asks a small function, powercloud-presign, for a link to that one object. The function runs with a role that can only read the photo bucket, and the link stops working after 15 minutes. The application then saves the bytes behind the link into its local cache with HTTP-DOWNLOAD. AwsLambda.Invoke needs AllowWrite on, because a function can do whatever its code says.</Property>
